            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight" style="font-family: var(--font-heading); letter-spacing: -0.03em;">Tech and Digital SEO</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 fade-up stagger-child" style="--i:1;">Birmingham's tech sector clusters around the Custard Factory in Digbeth and Innovation Birmingham Campus in Aston. SaaS companies, digital agencies, fintech startups, enterprise software providers — each with different SEO requirements and different budgets.</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4 fade-up stagger-child" style="--i:2;">Startup SEO means building authority fast on limited spend. We find low-competition long-tail keywords that deliver relevant traffic while the domain matures. We build content programmes that establish thought leadership. We secure early backlinks from tech publications. For SaaS, we target comparison keywords, feature-specific landing pages, and content for each stage of the buyer journey.</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed fade-up stagger-child" style="--i:3;">Established tech companies benefit from scaled content production, competitive keyword capture, and programmatic SEO assets covering the long tail. We integrate <a href="/ai-search-optimisation-birmingham/" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light font-bold transition-colors">AI search optimisation</a> from day one for tech businesses — their audience adopts AI search tools earliest.</p>
