          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4 fade-up stagger-child" style="--i:1;">HS2 infrastructure. Commercial regeneration across the city centre. Residential demand that never stops. Birmingham's construction sector drives sustained search volume for trades and specialist contractors.</p>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4 fade-up stagger-child" style="--i:2;">Trade businesses get massive value from local SEO. "Plumber near me" and "builder Birmingham" are high-intent queries that drive calls and form fills directly. Google Business Profile, reviews, and local landing pages form the foundation. For larger construction firms chasing commercial contracts, B2B content strategy and industry directories become the priority levers.</p>
          <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed fade-up stagger-child" style="--i:3;">We build trade SEO around lead generation efficiency. Every page has a defined conversion path. Schema markup supports rich results in local search. Content targets the service queries that produce paying customers. The metric is cost per lead — not vanity traffic.</p>
